95 units, so it fits in the warehouse. It also pays the 43 order fee about 4 fewer times than the every-2-day plans, saving around 170.\n- **Plan 5 (every 3 days, larger).** About 163 units of item 1 plus leftover stock comes close to the 232 limit, so some deliveries will be partly lost.\n- **Plan 4 (every 4 days).** The 196-unit batch of item 1 plus the item 0 already in stock exceeds the limit, and so does the next item 0 arrival. It loses a lot to overflow.\n- **Plan 7 (daily orders).** About 25 order days cost roughly 540 more in fees than ordering every 2 days. Its buffer is also thin, about 1.1 times forecast.\n\n**Estimated order:** 3, 0, 2, 6, then 5, 1, 7, 4. Plans 2, 6, 5 and 1 are close together, so I have kept the probabilities moderate rather than near 0 or 1."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4398, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4398}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:17:37.696Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVQgo97qPWPU7sGzQ4aq"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01NwA8zbSud6VG8ZkxE77Yoe", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVQgoQVYS9FTfX3ZwTSL", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01NwA8zbSud6VG8ZkxE77Yoe", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.72, 0.35, 0.6, 0.7, 0.12